law.text:
		Each blasting cable shall be:

Well insulated and as long as necessary to allow the shot firer to move to a safe place around a corner;


Short-circuited at the battery end until it is ready to attach to the blasting unit;


Staggered as to length, or shall have its ends kept well separated when attached to the detonator leg wires; and


Kept clear of power wires and all other possible sources of active or stray electric currents.
